         ORIG 3000
START    LDX   U         rX ← u.
         JMP   2F
1H       STX   V         v ← rX.
         SRAX  5         rAX ← rA.
         DIV   V         rX ← rAX mod v.
2H       LDA   V         rA ← v.
         JXNZ  1B        Done if rX = 0.
         HLT
U        CON   40902
V        CON   24140
         END   START
